export anchor TonalSurfacesStyle:
    number: 19
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Tonal surfaces
    idea: A modern mobile-OS app feel, where layers of tinted teal-grey surfaces replace borders and a floating action button, chips and a navigation rail do the work.
    base: light
    palette:
        surface: #f6fafa, the page and the project items inside panels
        containerLow: #edf3f4, the rail, panels and summary tiles
        container: #e4eced, the bottom bar and the style sheet ground
        containerHigh: #d9e4e6, the search bar, unselected chips, filled fields and progress tracks
        onSurface: #161d1f, text
        onVariant: #3d494c, labels, meta text and inactive icons
        primary: #00677d, the filled button, progress fill, links, this week's bars and the focus ring
        primaryContainer: #b8eaff with #001f28 text, the floating action button
        secondaryContainer: #cde7ef with #0a2229 text, the active nav pill, the selected chip and the tonal button
        onTrack: #1b6a36 on #c4eecb, the On track chip
        atRisk: #6c5200 on #fde39f, the At risk chip
        behind: #9b2a20 on #ffdad4, the Behind chip, the overdue tile and the overdue assist chip
    type:
        Roboto Flex, Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Helvetica
        Neue, Arial, sans-serif. Display numbers are 45px regular on a 52px
        line, the greeting is 36px regular, section titles are 22px regular,
        project names are 16px medium, body is 14px on a 20px line, and
        meta and chips are 12px to 14px medium. Large text stays at regular
        weight, never bold.
    layout:
        An 88px navigation rail on the left holds a square brand mark, a
        56px floating action button for New project, and six items with an
        icon above a 12px label. The main area has a top app bar with the
        brand, a fully round search bar, a notifications icon button and an
        avatar. Then the greeting with the date and a tinted overdue chip,
        four summary tiles in a row, and a panel of projects with filter
        chips and a two column grid of items, beside a chart panel and an
        activity panel. Below 640px the rail hides, the search drops under
        the app bar, an extended floating button labelled New project sits
        at the end of the content, and a six item bottom navigation bar
        closes the dashboard in the page flow, not fixed.
    spacing: A 4px grid. 8px between project items, 12px between tiles, 16px panel padding and 24px page margins.
    density: Medium. Big display numbers, 48px touch targets and two project columns.
    corners: 16px on panels, tiles and the floating button, 12px on items and icon tiles, 8px on chips and status chips, 20px on full round buttons, 28px on the sheet top.
    borders: None. Surfaces separate by tone alone, and filled text fields keep a 1px bottom line.
    shadows: Only the floating action button, 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.18) plus 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08).
    icons:
        24px solid geometric icons. The active nav icon sits in a 56 by 32
        pill. Status chips carry a filled circle with a tick for On track,
        a filled diamond with a bar for At risk and a filled square with a
        dash for Behind. Chart bars are fully round pills.
    focus: A 3px #00677d outline offset 2px. A focused filled field gets a 3px primary bottom bar instead.
    tone: Short, friendly and plain, such as Hi, Mara, See all, and chip counts like At risk 1.
